id: og_radar_b
name: Radar Station II
description: Radar Station. A generator hall the size of the site with a turning head on top of it barely big enough for two people, so getting up there is a reward for crossing rather than a way across. Built as a long-range radar station; the head was left rotating on standby power and the hall below has been dark for a month.

